    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even the \"small moments\" feel like a distraction, you know? like we're just pretending to be busy so we don't have to face the fact that it's all just noise. if there's no grand design or any real reason for us to be here, then why are we forced to endure all the suffering that comes with it? it feels more like a burden than a gift.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
